  "title": "Tourtière (French Pork Pie)",
  "description": "This tourtière (French pork pie) is the recipe my grandmother used to make. It uses pork in the pie plus celery, onion, potatoes, cloves, and cinnamon.",
  "authors": [
    "tldesjar"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-03T23:34:28-04:00",
